+# Twice as many steps between wild encounters (user request, 2026-11-02). Each step-triggered
+# encounter is cancelled half the time and the step count restarts as if one had happened, so
+# the average gap is exactly doubled with every item/ability modifier intact. Rock Smash
+# (triggered_by_step = false) and Poké Radar grass are untouched. Prepended: the v19.1 Hotfixes
+# plugin redefines encounter_triggered? with a bare def after Scripts, and nothing aliases it.
+module FireAshEncounterRate
+  def encounter_triggered?(enc_type, repel_active = false, triggered_by_step = true)
+    return false unless super
+    return true if !triggered_by_step || pbPokeRadarOnShakingGrass || rand(2) == 0
+    reset_step_count
+    false
+  end
+end
+PokemonEncounters.prepend(FireAshEncounterRate)
